---
import { url } from '../lib/url';
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="gemini-footer mt-auto">
  <div class="footer-top flex flex-wrap gap-6 mb-6 pb-6 border-b border-[#333]">
    <a href={url()} class="text-[#ccc] font-semibold no-underline hover:text-white">홈</a>
    <a href={url('about/')} class="text-[#ccc] font-semibold no-underline hover:text-white">개인정보처리방침</a>
    <a href={url('resources/')} class="text-[#ccc] font-semibold no-underline hover:text-white">정보공개</a>
    <a href={url('organizations/')} class="text-[#ccc] font-semibold no-underline hover:text-white">찾아오시는 길</a>
  </div>
  <div class="footer-info">
    <p class="mb-1.5">
      <span class="mr-4"><b>이능관리위원회</b></span>
      <span>서울특별시 ○○구 ○○로 1 (가상)</span>
    </p>
    <p class="mb-1.5">
      <span class="mr-4">대표전화: 1551-0000 (등재/민원)</span>
      <span>폭주 및 미등재자 신고: 국번없이 11X (가상)</span>
    </p>
    <p class="copyright mt-4 font-mono text-xs">
      COPYRIGHT © SUPERNATURAL ABILITY MANAGEMENT COMMITTEE. {year}. ALL RIGHTS RESERVED.
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>
